   "id": "s0",
   "title": "Known values",
   "text": "\\[\\begin{aligned}&\\text{Write the sine and cosine of both angles.}\\\\[5pt]&\\cos\\alpha=0,\\ \\sin\\alpha=1\\\\[5pt]&\\cos\\beta=\\dfrac{\\sqrt3}2,\\ \\sin\\beta=\\dfrac12\\end{aligned}\\]",
